    "rich_text_6QrD34": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_RVRFhm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Traditional salt-based water softeners are expensive, maintenance-heavy systems that require regular salt refilling, electricity, plumbing modifications, and continuous servicing. These systems also waste a significant amount of water during the regeneration process and usually require dedicated installation space.</p><p>In comparison, Scale-O Salt-Free Water Softener offers a simple overhead tank solution that works without salt, electricity, or plumbing changes. Scale-O uses advanced food-grade media technology to help reduce hard water scaling while maintaining a zero-maintenance experience for homeowners.</p><h4>Why Scale-O Salt Free Water Softener is Better</h4><ul><li>No salt refilling required</li><li>No water wastage from regeneration cycles</li><li>No electricity consumption</li><li>DIY installation in minutes</li><li>No plumbing or pipe cutting needed</li><li>Zero operating cost after installation</li><li>Compact overhead tank setup</li><li>Lower initial investment compared to salt systems</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_RVRFhm"
