    "rich_text_9hDh7U": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_PyUmCq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Electro-magnetic water softeners rely on electricity and magnetic/electrical signals to alter mineral behavior in water. These systems often require professional installation, electrical dependency, and additional piping or mounting support.</p><p>Scale-O Salt-Free Water Softener eliminates these complexities with a completely passive, power-free design. Installed directly inside the overhead water tank, Scale-O works continuously without wiring, power consumption, or external system dependency.</p><h4>Why Scale-O Salt Free Water Softener is Better</h4><ul><li>Zero electricity or power usage</li><li>No electronic components or breakdown risk</li><li>No external installation setup required</li><li>No technical maintenance needed</li><li>Lower operating costs</li><li>Works directly inside overhead tanks</li><li>Easier and faster DIY installation</li><li>No dependency on continuous electrical supply</li></ul><h4></h4>"
          }
        }
      },
