    "rich_text_axK6xG": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_49XcrY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Why This Matters</h4><p>Traditional systems often become expensive due to:</p><ul><li>Salt purchases</li><li>Valve replacements</li><li>Leakage issues</li><li>Service visits</li><li>Water regeneration cycles</li><li>Refills</li><li>Cartridge Replacement</li><li>Power Costs</li><li>Higher operational costs</li></ul><p>Scale-O helps eliminate many of these recurring expenses with its salt free water softener<strong> </strong>design.</p><h4>Save More with Scale-O</h4><p>Traditional water softeners often become expensive because of:</p><ul><li>Salt refill costs</li><li>Electricity bills</li><li>Plumbing repairs</li><li>AMC & servicing charges</li><li>Water wastage</li></ul><p>Scale-O helps reduce these recurring costs with its zero-maintenance salt-free water softener design.</p><h4>Why Scale-O Is Becoming One of the Best Water Softener Systems in India</h4><p>Scale-O is built specifically for Indian homes dealing with hard water through overhead tanks.</p><h4>Designed for Indian Homes</h4><p>Perfect for:</p><ul><li>Villas</li><li>Bungalows</li><li>Duplex homes</li><li>Independent houses</li><li>Farmhouses</li></ul><h4>Salt-Free Operation</h4><p>No salt storage, no refilling hassles, and no chemical dependency.</p><h4>No Installation Complexity</h4><p>Simply place the unit inside the overhead water tank.</p><h4>No Water Wastage</h4><p>Unlike traditional systems, Scale-O does not waste water during regeneration.</p><h4>Low Maintenance</h4><p>No complicated valves, motors, or servicing schedules.</p><h4>Whole House Water Support</h4><p>Since Scale-O works through the overhead tank and underground pipe as well, it supports water flow across the entire home.</p><h4>Better Long-Term Value</h4><p>Lower operational costs make Scale-O a practical alternative to traditional hard water softener systems.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
