    "rich_text_BUyWhi": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_z8GRUi": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Who Should Choose Scale-O?</h4><p>Scale-O is specially designed for Indian homes dealing with borewell water, municipal water, and mixed hard water supply. Its overhead tank installation system makes it suitable for villas, independent homes, and bungalows across India. </p><p>Scale-O Salt-Free Water Softener is ideal for homeowners looking for a smarter, low-maintenance, and cost-effective solution for hard water problems. Designed specifically for Indian homes with overhead water tanks, Scale-O helps protect appliances, reduce hard water scaling, improve water flow, and keep bathrooms cleaner with less maintenance.</p><p>Unlike traditional water softeners that require electricity, salt refilling, plumbing modifications, and regular servicing, Scale-O works with zero maintenance and zero operating cost. Its salt-free technology helps homeowners save money over the long term by reducing appliance repair costs, minimizing plumbing issues, avoiding recurring maintenance expenses, and eliminating electricity and salt usage.</p><p>With simple DIY installation and whole-house hard water protection, Scale-O offers an affordable and user-friendly hard water softener solution for villas, bungalows, duplex homes, and independent houses looking for better water quality and long-term savings.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
